+
+Available and observed: isolated linked worktree; worktree-local mobile dependencies; shared Python3.11 venv used read-only; Xcode27.1/Swift6.4; Node26.7/npm11.19; Android Studio bundled JDK21 and local SDK; Docker29.2.1 with cached PostgreSQL17 image. Exact commands/outputs in [environment.json](../evidence/release-readiness/RC00/environment.json). Actual native compatibility is RC01, not inferred from installed tools.
