+No physical device installation authorized or attempted. Signing identities/profiles, GitHub hosted CI, provider account quotas and staging credentials/resources were not accessed. Their availability and human owners are UNVERIFIED. Runtime platform minima and optional Health Connect guard must be confirmed by RC01 build manifests; the supported commercial OS matrix requires device/product signoff.
